The subject pretty much says it all.  For all of you who have been wondering
what has happened to all the posts from Ken and me here at the site of the
Wheaton Spoilers, they tried installing a new version of news software here,
and our news posting ability has been down for the last month or month and
a half.  Well, our posting ability is back up (at least until further notice -
ha ha!), so I figured I'd make the most of it.

We are currently working on a new version of the spoilers, which is currently
(tentatively) slated for release on May 1, 1991.  We will be adding several
new sections, and revising several existing ones.

As for those of you who have mailed to the nhspoil account, yes, I have been
receiving your messages - I've just been to busy to respond to them.  Also,
please remember - WE DO NOT E-MAIL COPIES OF THE SPOILERS.  I am posting 
information today about how to ftp, uucp, or retrieve the spoilers via
e-mail, and will probably post this information about every two weeks (news
feed willing :-).

Thanks for bearing with us!

